[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1508","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0746","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Microsoft IIS 4.0 和 5.0 的 shtml.dll 组件中。其原理是服务器在处理错误消息时，未能对用户输入的参数进行适当的过滤或转义，导致恶意脚本可以直接被回显至客户端浏览器。攻击者可以通过诱导受害者访问一个包含特制脚本的恶意链接，使脚本在受信任站点的上下文中执行。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响 IIS 版本的服务器，可导致会话劫持、敏感信息泄露或页面内容篡改。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0746"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23Z","remediation":"建议将 IIS 服务器升级至 5.0 以上版本或安装微软发布的相应安全更新补丁。由于 IIS 4.0/5.0 已极其陈旧且不再受支持，强烈建议迁移至更新的 Windows Server 操作系统及现代 IIS 版本，以从根本上消除此类跨站脚本漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1594","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1595","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=39A12BD6.E811BF4F%40nat.bg","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-060","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0746.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0746.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0746","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0746.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d7a076478478ace961ac114128fbcbb4e54a11aa/2000/CVE-2000-0746.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0746.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/de5e978a48281a824409de119a9380c20aa11e39/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0746.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0746.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0746.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2000-0746.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1506","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0713","title":"Adobe Acrobat 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat 4.05、Reader、Business Tools 及 Fill In 等处理 PDF 文件的产品中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含超长 /Registry 或 /Ordering 说明符的恶意 PDF 文件，诱导用户打开后触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而在用户权限上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Adobe Acrobat 4.05 及相关产品，CVSS 评分 7.6（AV:N/AC:H/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），攻击需用户交互打开恶意文件，利用方式为构造畸形 PDF 触发栈溢出实现任意代码执行。Adobe 已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0713"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:19Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Adobe Acrobat 5.0 或更高版本（Acrobat 5.0 于 2001 年发布已修复该缓冲区溢出漏洞）。若无法立即升级，建议：1）禁止打开不可信来源的 PDF 文件；2）在邮件网关/防火墙层面拦截携带超长 /Registry 或 /Ordering 字段的 PDF 附件；3）在终端部署应用程序控制策略，禁止 Acrobat 4.x 打开外部 PDF 文件，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0382.html","http://www.adobe.com/misc/pdfsecurity.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1509","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0713.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0713","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0713.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0713.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0713.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-0713.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0713.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0713.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0713.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0713.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1500","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0687","title":"Auction Weaver CGI 脚本任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Auction Weaver CGI 脚本 1.03 及更早版本中存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 catdir 参数提交包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制请求，突破目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、密码文件等），CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。受影响系统未提供有效输入过滤机制，建议升级至最新版本或禁用该 CGI 脚本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0687"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:16Z","remediation":"立即升级 Auction Weaver CGI 脚本至 1.04 或更高版本（如厂商已停止维护，则彻底移除该 CGI 脚本）。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache mod_rewrite 或 Nginx 访问控制规则）对 catdir 参数进行输入过滤，拦截包含 `../` 或 `..` 的请求，防止目录遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0310.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1630","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0687","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8fb1620294bff0cde2c82bba8543a916d4f0215c/2000/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0687.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0687.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0687.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1500.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1500.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1409","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0681","title":"BEA WebLogic Server 代理插件缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic Server 代理插件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含超长 .JSP 扩展名的特制 URL 请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 BEA WebLogic Server 相关版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者可完全控制受影响的服务器，窃取敏感数据、植入后门或发起进一步攻击。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0681"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:15Z","remediation":"升级 BEA WebLogic Server 至 5.1.0 Service Pack 11 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，在反向代理或 Web 服务器层面配置规则，拦截包含超长 .JSP 后缀的 URL 请求，限制 URL 长度不超过 2048 字节作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0186.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1570","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0681.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0681.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0681.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0681","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0681.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0681.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0681.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0681.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08990b84a65d14f7de760be267bdf98ec816883a/2000/CVE-2000-0681.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0681.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1409.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1408","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0677","title":"IBM Net.Data db2www CGI 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"IBB Net.Data 的 db2www CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 PATH_INFO 环境变量提交超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞攻击复杂度低且无需认证，利用方式简单，可导致系统被完全控制。受影响系统需谨慎部署安全补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0677"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 IBM Net.Data 至 7.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了 db2www CGI 程序在处理 PATH_INFO 环境变量时的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面限制对 db2www CGI 脚本的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 调用，并配置 Web 服务器对 CGI 输入参数长度进行限制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise60.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4976","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0677.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0677.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0677","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0677.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0677.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0677.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/878a3042444029b151459a1565a690101509a27a/2000/CVE-2000-0677.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0677.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0677.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0677.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1408.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1209","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0563","title":"Apple MacOS Runtime Java 及 Microsoft VM HTTP 重定向绕过安全限制漏洞","description":"MacOS Runtime Java (MRJ) 2.1 及更早版本以及 MacOS 版 Microsoft 虚拟机中的 URLConnection 函数存在安全绕过漏洞。恶意网站运营者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 重定向响应，诱使 Java 应用程序建立到任意主机的网络连接，从而违反 Java 安全模型中的同源策略。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用该漏洞，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。成功利用此漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露、中间人攻击或进一步的内网渗透。受影响的平台包括 MacOS 上的 Apple MRJ 和 Microsoft Java VM。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0563"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00Z","remediation":"升级 MacOS Runtime Java (MRJ) 至 2.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了 URLConnection 重定向绕过安全模型的问题。如无法升级，在浏览器中禁用 Java applet 支持，或通过系统偏好设置关闭 Java 运行时环境。对于使用 Microsoft VM 的场景，卸载旧版 Microsoft VM for MacOS 并改用 Apple 官方提供的 MRJ 2.2+。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0056.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1336","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-05-8&msg=391C95DE2DA.5E3BTAKAGI%40java-house.etl.go.jp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0563.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0563","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0563.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0563.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p854-gmj6-9jfw/GHSA-p854-gmj6-9jfw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0563.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1336/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0563.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0951","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0951.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0802","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 权限提升漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0802是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0802"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30Z","remediation":"立即卸载或停止 BAIR 程序。打开\"HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run\"，删除名为\"BAIR Secure\"的注册表启动项即可永久关闭 BAIR 拦截。同时重启系统后重新启动 regedit，并重置 IE Internet 选项中的代理设置。若需长期保障，建议升级使用内置于 Windows 的家长控制或第三方权限管理工具替代此存在缺陷的第三方拦截软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96430372326912&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1babb409c908ee5fdab519495238fe03dea56d31/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d6db6ddfb07ef853c79bb625eb614ba3cefe7aaf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0802","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b2f373c503e602e6a03f4a3557938637ea6e50dc/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/362d7f5e0706bdc06d68400ac31e2f3922538550/2000/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0802.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/fd9cadff39b120393c2c764effdf6aaef24df325/api/2000/CVE-2000-0802.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0802.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0951.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0950","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0950.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0801","title":"HP HP-UX 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.00 中的 bdf 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过传递过长的 -t 选项参数触发栈缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址实现任意代码执行，从而提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 11.00 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），攻击向量为本地，需拥有系统普通用户权限即可利用。攻击者只需在本地执行特制的 bdf 命令即可完成权限提升，无需远程交互。HP 官方已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0801"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:30Z","remediation":"立即更新HP-UX 11.00到11.04或更高版本，应用HP IR10242 HP-UX 11.00安全更新包，替换/bin/bdf程序文件，并禁用bdf命令对未知用户的访问权限。如果无法立即更新，可使用操作系统安全缓解工具(stack execution protection)和运行时堆栈溢出检测工具，并在/etc/security/secdefault中限制本地用户权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0388.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1520","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d6db6ddfb07ef853c79bb625eb614ba3cefe7aaf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0801","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b2f373c503e602e6a03f4a3557938637ea6e50dc/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/94607cd5f476edf9a266e633e1be7e43ab890e1c/2000/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0801.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0801.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0801.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0950.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0949","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0949.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0792","title":"Gnome Lokkit 防火墙安全绕过漏洞","description":"gnome-lokkit 防火墙软件包在版本 0.41 及更早版本中存在安全绕过漏洞。攻击者无需任何身份验证即可向目标系统发送特制的网络请求，绕过防火墙验证机制，从而访问那些原本不应开放的系统端口或服务。该漏洞的攻击难度较低，可通过简单的网络请求即可触发，可能导致部分机密信息泄露、系统完整性破坏以及服务可用性降低。漏洞影响典型场景包括未正确配置防火墙策略的用户主机，攻击者可利用此漏洞获取对目标系统的部分控制权限。本漏洞的 CVSS 评分高达 7.5，反映了其对网络安全构成的严重威胁。该漏洞已在后续的 gnome-lokkit 更新中得到了修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0792"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29Z","remediation":"升级 gnome-lokkit 到 0.41 或更高版本（如通过包管理器执行 `yum update gnome-lokkit` 或 `apt-get install gnome-lokkit=0.41*`）。若无法立即升级，请手动检查 iptables 规则确保未开放非预期端口，或临时使用 `iptables -P INPUT DROP` 设置默认拒绝策略并显式放行所需服务端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0252.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1520","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1590","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0792","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/790c2d6c2f00f7f154de7420ee269c333853d9a4/2000/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0792.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0792.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0792.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0949.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0948","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0948.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0791","title":"Trustix Apache-SSL RPM 权限漏洞","description":"Trustix Secure Linux 的 Apache-SSL RPM 包在安装 httpsd 程序时设置了全局可写权限，导致本地用户可将其替换为恶意木马程序。该漏洞影响 Trustix 发行版中使用 Apache-SSL 的系统，攻击者需具备本地账户权限，通过覆盖 httpsd 二进制文件实现权限提升，在 Apache-SSL 服务重启或受害者执行时以提升后的权限运行任意代码，CVSS 评分 4.6 属中危级别。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0791"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29Z","remediation":"升级 Trustix 系统至 Apache-SSL 1.3.14-2 或更高版本（含权限修复补丁）；或手动执行 chmod 755 /usr/sbin/httpsd 移除世界可写权限；同时限制非特权用户对 Web 服务二进制文件的写入访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0179.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1575","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0791","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/790c2d6c2f00f7f154de7420ee269c333853d9a4/2000/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0791.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0791.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0791.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0948.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0947","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0947.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0790","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 在 Windows 98 系统上的基于 Web 的文件夹显示功能存在安全漏洞，本地攻击者可通过修改 Folder.htt 模板文件，并利用 ShellDefView ActiveX 控件的 InvokeVerb 方法指定文件夹中首个文件的默认执行选项，从而植入并执行木马程序。该漏洞影响运行 IE 5.5 的 Windows 98 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响），攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限才能利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0790"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29Z","remediation":"由于Windows 98已停止支持，建议立即升级至Windows 2000 SP4或更高版本（如Windows XP SP3），并将Internet Explorer升级至6.0 SP1或更高版本。临时缓解措施：在注册表中禁用ShellDefView ActiveX控制（HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\CLSID\\{...}\\Implement Categories\\{00021494-0000-0000-C000-000000000046}），或设置Folder.htt文件为只读权限防止篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1571","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=3998370D.732A03F1%40nat.bg","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5097","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0790","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5ed7d4ade31e30e11184c586fbedcdecf9f82568/2000/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0790.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0790.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0790.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0947.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0946","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0946.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0789","title":"Bardon Data Systems WinU 密码弱加密漏洞","description":"博登数据系统 WinU 5.x 及更早版本在存储配置密码时采用弱加密算法，本地攻击者可通过逆向分析或暴力破解还原加密后的密码，从而获取配置凭据并提升本地系统权限。该漏洞位于 WinU 的密码存储模块，攻击者无需远程访问权限，只需具备本地系统的普通用户或物理访问权限即可触发漏洞。由于加密强度不足，口令 easily 被还原，可能导致配置泄露、权限提升以及后续横向移动。CVSS 评分为 4.6，危害等级中等，建议用户升级至支持更安全加密算法的版本并重新设置口令。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0789"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:29Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于 Bardon Data Systems WinU 5.x 及更早版本中，因使用弱加密算法存储配置密码，本地攻击者可解密密码并提升权限。建议立即升级到 WinU 5.5 或更高版本（如有可用补丁请务必安装），若无法升级，可通过以下措施降低风险：1）限制非授权用户访问安装 WinU 的系统，移除本地用户对 WinU 配置文件的读取权限；2）定期更换配置密码，并避免在配置文件中存储敏感凭据；3）在注册表中加密存储密码或使用更安全的密码管理方案替代内置弱加密机制。由于该软件已停维护，建议考虑迁移到其他安全性更高的替代软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0201.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0789.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0789.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0789","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0789.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0789.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0789.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c0d14064d79c9a0ab84002492c5a6bf474f81cd3/2000/CVE-2000-0789.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0789.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0789.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0789.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0946.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0945","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0945.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0786","title":"GNU userv 安全绕过漏洞","description":"tags. The task says I can briefly analyze first but final answer must be in <value> tags. I'll just output the value.<value>GNU userv 1.0.0 及更早版本在文件描述符交换过程中存在安全缺陷，未能正确执行文件描述符的交换操作，导致 USERV_GROUPS 与 USERV_GIDS 两个环境变量被破坏或污染，从而令本地用户得以绕过部分访问限制。该漏洞的核心原理在于权限校验所依赖的环境变量可能被非法篡改，攻击者只需具备本地登录权限，通过构造特定运行环境即可触发，进而绕过系统的访问控制机制，实现权限提升或越权操作。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 4.6，危害等级为中危，建议受影响的用户及时升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0786"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0389.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96473640717095&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000727","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1516","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0786.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0786.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0786","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0786.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0786.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/47bb69b00d30a4ddac9a224d4b4672d3efbf78ef/2000/CVE-2000-0786.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0786.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0786.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0786.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0786.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0945.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0944","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0944.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0785","title":"WircSrv IRC Server 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"WircSrv IRC Server 5.07s 的 importmotd 命令存在任意文件读取漏洞，该命令用于设置服务器每日消息（MOTD），但未对指定文件路径进行有效限制。具有 IRC 管理员权限的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 importmotd 命令并指向目标系统上的任意文件路径，使服务器读取该文件内容并设置为 MOTD，从而泄露敏感文件信息。此漏洞影响 WircSrv IRC Server 5.07s 版本，攻击复杂度低，可被远程利用，攻击者无需额外认证即可读取服务器上的敏感文件，造成信息泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0785"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28Z","remediation":"升级到修复了 importmotd 命令访问控制的 WircSrv 后续版本，或通过修改配置文件限制 IRC operators 对 importmotd 命令的使用权限，仅允许特权管理员执行该操作。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或文件系统层面限制 IRC 服务器进程对 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件的读取权限，并确保服务器以最小权限账户运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96353027909756&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67c9200e969a6d3d408c757f270927299404e0d3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8c20cffcbf7c376fa6433e6fcbfd5a910a99bc5e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0785","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/931028af390b5904ba4e24b7aec655099c64a842/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4c1d8c29952c8fcc0c670bb507296ea962f64532/2000/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/bdacb513223e345f8b96b8a02bdaae5d233fe301/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0785.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/0bbfd26fc571ca6007617e5478445a4da1f7eeff/api/2000/CVE-2000-0785.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0785.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0944.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0941","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0941.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0783","title":"WatchGuard Firebox II 认证服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0783是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0783"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:28Z","remediation":"建议升级至 WatchGuard Firebox II 修复该漏洞的固件版本（具体版本号请参考 WatchGuard 官方安全公告），或联系 WatchGuard 技术支持获取最新可用固件。如无法立即升级，可在边界防火墙或 ACL 中限制对设备 4100 端口（认证服务）的入站访问来源，仅允许可信管理网段访问，以临时缓解恶意构造 URL 导致的拒绝服务风险。若设备已超出支持生命周期，建议更换至受支持的 WatchGuard 下一代防火墙型号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0162.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1573","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5098","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/80412b90a38768c394cf0415ba21346e66691f21/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0783.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1dbe12fff7dc046e8b82d6a12cc90fa3b7047152/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0783.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0783","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0783.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a